stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Discovered
    Discovered --> Validated: contracts and requirements
    Validated --> Bound: dependencies resolved
    Bound --> Active: activation succeeds
    Bound --> Failed: activation fails
    Active --> Retiring: stop new unrelated roots
    Retiring --> Retired: calls and resources settled
    Retiring --> Failed: bounded failure policy
    Active --> Failed: trap or provider failure
    Failed --> Retired: dependents and resources resolved
    Retired --> [*]
